              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">VIVO Treadmill Desk with Cup Holder (STAND-TDML2A)</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Best tray</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">34.1 x 11 in. board with cup holder and phone slot</td></tr>
