          </p>
          <p>
            Measure three things first: the diameter and shape of the bar you want to use, the
            diameter of your bottle or tumbler at the point a holder would grip it, and, for a tray,
            the distance between the outside edges of your two handrails. Those three numbers rule
            most products in or out before you read a single review.
          </p>
        </div>
